  "id": "BIT-ghost-2026-103268",
  "summary": "Ghost 1.0.0 before 6.62.0 Suspension Bypass via Password Reset",
  "details": "Ghost versions before 6.62.0 contain an authentication bypass vulnerability that allows suspended staff users to reactivate their accounts through self-service password reset. Attackers with suspended staff credentials can perform password reset operations to regain active account access and restore their original privileges.",
